/v1/","context":{"app_id":5036910,"app_scope":"base","country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100,"review_scope":"store_summary_filtered","percentage_precision":"source_rounded_integer","review_score_label":"사용자 평가 없음"},"error_code":"no_reviews"}],"events":[{"id":"steam-steam-5036910-1841579228677016","game_id":"steam-5036910","kind":"announcement","title":"You said it was confusing. So now it teaches you.","summary":"A tutorial you play, not one you read A creator recorded fourteen minutes of themselves playing the demo. They said the mechanics seemed solid, then spent most of the video not knowing what was happening. Someone else, who already knew hanafuda, wrote that the explanations were too thin for anyone who didn't. Both were right, about different things. So the demo now opens with the tutorial. Eight steps, on a real table with real rules — nothing is faked It hands you one card at a time and tells y","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T01:22:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228677016","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:00:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5036910-1841579228673402","game_id":"steam-5036910","kind":"announcement","title":"The first ten minutes, rebuilt — and the bug that froze the table is fixed","summary":"The first ten minutes Median playtime on the demo was seven minutes. Four out of ten people closed it inside ten. The game wasn't too hard — people were leaving before they knew what they were building toward. This update rebuilds that first stretch, and removes a bug that could end a run outright. The scoring wasn't hard to understand. It was printed wrong. While cutting new footage for the store page I froze a frame and read the score line: 130 × ×53 Two multiplication signs. The separator bet","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-23T13:13:22Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228673402","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:00:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5036910-1841579228664189","game_id":"steam-5036910","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo is out — six nights, Busan to Daegu, free","summary":"It's 1999. You owe a loan shark 200,000,000 won and you have twenty-four nights to pay it back. The demo is the first six. Two cities. Busan, then Daegu. Six nights, and every third one is a boss. Boss Kang out of Jagalchi collects 30% faster than you do, and the Hwang family in Daegu just make the hill steeper. It plays with hwatu The Korean flower cards. Forty-eight of them, twelve months, four cards each. No numbers, no suits. If you've never held one, the game teaches you as you go. The scor","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-20T02:49:44Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228664189","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:00:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5036910-1840944183775409","game_id":"steam-5036910","kind":"announcement","title":"I made a video explaining every card in the deck","summary":"Most people who find this game have never held a Hwatu card.That is probably the biggest barrier between GO, STOP and someone actually trying it, so I sat down and made a proper beginner’s guide.Forty-eight cards.Twelve months, four cards each.No numbers, no familiar suits, and almost nothing that works the way a standard Western deck does.Instead, every month is represented by a plant or seasonal image.January is pine. February is plum blossom. March is cherry blossom. August has the full moon ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-13T01:28:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183775409","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:00:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5036910-1840310314347303","game_id":"steam-5036910","kind":"announcement","title":"The page is up — GO, STOP is coming","summary":"Hi — I make GO, STOP. Alone, which is part of why this took a while.The store page is finally up, so I can actually talk about it.It's a roguelike deckbuilder, except instead of poker hands it runs on hwatu — Korean flower cards. If you've seen them before it was probably in a film: a folding table, cigarette smoke, money on it. That's the right image.Here's the setup. It's 1999. You owe Wolgok-dang ₩200,000,000 and you have 24 nights to pay it. You start in Busan. They're in Seoul, eight cities","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-08T11:50:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314347303","verified_at":"2026-10-20T21:00:54Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5036910":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:15:19Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-25T22:15:18Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5036910":"2026-10-25T22:15:19Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5036910":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:15:18Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T22:15:18Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5076380":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-25T22:15:19Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-25T22:15:19Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5036910","app_id":5036910,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:19Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_ite